					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-602508#post-1670789</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-602508/scp-419-j#post-1670789</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 26 Dec 2012 15:42:56 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>wishun</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1204404</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Sometimes I wonder if there is a real Nigerian prince somewhere. Blindly calling out for someone, anyone, to lend him the small assitance he needs to unlock his vast wealth. All he asks for is a little trust, and he is willing to reward greatly the kind and chivalrous soul that aides him in his hour of need. But time and again his heartfelt entreaties go unanswered, consigned to the recycling bin unread and unremembered. Still he trys, his honor and his duty to his people demand that he must strive to free the treasury from its beuracratic limbo.</p> <p>Prince Niger is my modern Sisyphus.</p> <p>Also, why do people keep falling for 419 scams in this day and age? I think all that google-translate &quot;engrish&quot; is actually a cover for a mild memetic compulsion trigger. Most of us have been inoculated due to Foundation containment efforts, but a small percentage are still susceptible.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
